{"headword":"חֵ֫רֶם²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m. net (</strong>as something perforated; cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">مُخَرَّمٌ</span> <em>perforated work</em>, Fl in NHWB<sup>ii. 208</sup>; NH <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵרֶם</span> <em>net;</em> Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">חרם</span> <em>maker of nets</em><strong>)</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:2\" href=\"/Micah.7.2\">Mi 7:2</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרְמִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.3\">Ez 32:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרְמוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:15\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.15\">Hb 1:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:16\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:17\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.17\">17</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרָמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:26\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.26\">Ec 7:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.5\">Ez 26:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.10\">47:10</a>;—<em>hunter’s net</em> <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:2\" href=\"/Micah.7.2\">Mi 7:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:26\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.26\">Ec 7:26</a>; <em>fisherman’s net</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.5\">Ez 26:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.3\">32:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.10\">47:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:15\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.15\">Hb 1:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:16\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:17\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.17\">17</a>."}]},"rid":"BDB03477","strong_numbers":["2764"],"next_hw":"חֶרְמֵשׁ","prev_hw":"חָרַם²","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"II.","quotes":[],"GK":["3051","3052"],"TWOT":["744a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"s